The [[Wooden Buckler]] is a common [[Shield]] available in the shop to all characters. When the character is hit by a [[Melee]] attack, it prevents 7 damage and removes 0.3 stamina from the opponent. It can be upgraded to the [[Spiked Shield]], [[Frozen Buckler]], or [[Hero Shield]], all of which block more damage and have additional positive effects. The [[Frozen Buckler]] and [[Hero Shield]] also remove more stamina than the [[Wooden Buckler]].
